WEBVTT

00:07.665 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:42.105 --> 01:44.265
If he didn't want something from you,

01:44.345 --> 01:48.785
why would he be so nice
as to teach you Spanish?

01:50.505 --> 01:52.345
What could he possibly want from me?

01:57.105 --> 01:59.145
You're overthinking it.

02:06.145 --> 02:07.185
Just overthinking it.

02:09.785 --> 02:10.744
Overthinking it.

02:13.665 --> 02:14.985
What's going on?

02:16.785 --> 02:17.865
Wait, wait.

02:17.945 --> 02:18.985
Come on.

02:20.105 --> 02:21.065
What did I say?

02:27.425 --> 02:28.345
Alright, alright. Here, like this.

02:28.425 --> 02:29.945
You turn around. Turn around.

02:30.025 --> 02:31.465
Someone might see you.

02:33.945 --> 02:34.945
I'll shield you.

02:36.505 --> 02:38.065
Ten more seconds.

02:42.105 --> 02:43.105
I'm good.

02:47.025 --> 02:47.985
Oh my God.

02:49.105 --> 02:50.625
So embarrassing.

02:50.705 --> 02:52.945
People will think I'm bullying you.

02:54.425 --> 02:56.825
I don't cry in front of others.

02:57.905 --> 03:00.185
But with you… Ugh. What's this?

03:00.265 --> 03:01.105
Touch up your makeup.

03:01.625 --> 03:03.505
So I'm supposed to thank you?

03:04.585 --> 03:06.065
We barely ate anything.

03:12.745 --> 03:13.585
Missy.

03:14.545 --> 03:17.025
That's not how you do it. You pat it on.

03:21.425 --> 03:22.465
Give it here.

03:27.025 --> 03:30.345
I used to be wary of Ye Xinzhi.

03:30.945 --> 03:33.865
But seeing you now,
I'm guessing you've cleared things up?

03:34.465 --> 03:36.945
A single guy with his history

03:37.025 --> 03:39.745
and a simple girl like you
are on different paths.

03:40.345 --> 03:42.625
It's better for both of you
to draw the line early.

03:48.065 --> 03:49.105
Hold it back.

03:51.185 --> 03:52.265
Do you like him that much?

03:52.345 --> 03:53.585
I don't like him.

03:53.665 --> 03:55.225
I just…

04:06.505 --> 04:09.025
I just had a little crush.

04:09.105 --> 04:10.225
I only saved one photo.

04:10.305 --> 04:12.305
Is that not allowed?
Do I have to be warned for that?

04:15.665 --> 04:19.944
Listen, this is just
a passing infatuation.

04:20.025 --> 04:21.225
In less than two months,

04:21.305 --> 04:23.825
when you look back on him,
the spell will break.

04:23.905 --> 04:27.225
You'll think you were so silly.

04:27.825 --> 04:30.905
I figured it out while crying just now.

04:30.985 --> 04:33.065
What matters most to me right now
is my career.

04:33.145 --> 04:34.945
With a career, I can have any man I want.

04:35.025 --> 04:37.665
So after this Bolo Culture deal is done,

04:37.745 --> 04:39.385
I'll apply to Sha Sha.

04:39.465 --> 04:41.545
I want to go after
digital finance clients.

04:43.105 --> 04:43.985
Digital finance?

04:45.945 --> 04:47.385
He told me that too.

04:47.465 --> 04:48.665
When choosing industries,

04:48.745 --> 04:50.465
you have to find ones
with money and orders.

04:50.985 --> 04:52.345
If your first project

04:52.425 --> 04:56.025
wasn't an internet unicorn
like Bolo Culture,

04:56.585 --> 04:58.185
you wouldn't be standing here.

04:59.025 --> 05:00.945
He said if you want to last in consulting,

05:01.025 --> 05:03.865
you have to choose industries with
big budgets and strong growth potential.

05:09.065 --> 05:10.305
Eat up.

05:13.025 --> 05:14.345
Eat.

05:24.585 --> 05:26.145
Need to drop another 5,000.

05:27.265 --> 05:28.785
Five thousand…

05:29.625 --> 05:31.345
Five thousand's still not enough.
At least 10,000.

05:31.425 --> 05:32.265
AVERAGE TRANSACTION PRICE

05:33.345 --> 05:34.585
Are you buying an apartment?

05:36.305 --> 05:37.905
No, no. Just browsing.

05:38.505 --> 05:40.105
If you are buying, let me know.

05:40.185 --> 05:41.945
I'm a big client at their bank.

05:42.025 --> 05:44.465
I can put in a word
and get you the best rate.

05:44.545 --> 05:45.625
Really?

05:45.705 --> 05:48.145
No, no. I couldn't possibly.

05:48.225 --> 05:50.145
It's nothing. Just a fraction
of a percent on the rate.

05:50.225 --> 05:51.065
It's no big deal.

05:51.825 --> 05:54.185
Actually, I need a favor today.

05:54.265 --> 05:56.305
I had a fender bender with Lin Long.

05:56.385 --> 05:57.625
I took full responsibility,

05:57.705 --> 05:59.105
but it's a bit complicated.

05:59.185 --> 06:01.145
My car insurance is from out of town.

06:01.225 --> 06:03.145
I need her to sign off on something.

06:04.145 --> 06:06.145
Sure. I'll take care of it for you.

06:08.665 --> 06:11.065
I heard Lin Long's been having
a rough time lately?

06:15.425 --> 06:16.945
Give this to her.

06:17.025 --> 06:19.505
I went to Baiyun Temple the other day
and got one for everyone at the company.

06:20.465 --> 06:22.985
She was the one
who started this project after all.

06:23.585 --> 06:24.745
Just tell her I wish her

06:26.185 --> 06:28.105
a rebirth through hardship
and better days ahead.

06:29.665 --> 06:30.865
Sure.

06:31.705 --> 06:33.705
I started the project too. Where's mine?

06:38.385 --> 06:39.705
Don't you have your "senior"?

06:43.745 --> 06:44.825
I shouldn't have said that.

06:47.185 --> 06:49.785
Rebirth through hardship and better days?

06:50.905 --> 06:54.265
A client I've only known for a few days
sends me good wishes,

06:54.345 --> 06:58.865
but my legal husband
only has the cruelest words for me.

06:59.545 --> 07:00.425
Did he come after you?

07:01.025 --> 07:01.985
No.

07:02.065 --> 07:03.665
He just realized I didn't go home,

07:03.745 --> 07:05.505
moved straight
to the postpartum care center instead.

07:05.585 --> 07:07.145
And I changed my bank card PIN,

07:07.225 --> 07:08.985
so he figured out I want a divorce.

07:09.065 --> 07:11.705
He's got all our relatives and friends

07:11.785 --> 07:16.425
texting me, telling me
to come to my senses.

07:19.905 --> 07:22.065
I didn't get you a fruit basket.

07:22.585 --> 07:25.025
I picked out the newest shade of lipstick.

07:25.105 --> 07:26.625
It'll brighten up your complexion.

07:26.705 --> 07:30.305
Whether you end up
at the Civil Affairs Bureau or court,

07:30.385 --> 07:31.705
you won't look like you're losing.

07:35.705 --> 07:36.865
Look at you.

07:37.385 --> 07:39.785
Such a thoughtful girl. What--

07:39.865 --> 07:42.945
What was wrong with me back then?
Why did I have to push you out?

07:46.145 --> 07:48.665
I was a bit too aggressive, too.

07:49.545 --> 07:50.705
Sir, you can't go in.

07:50.785 --> 07:52.585
You can't go in, sir.

07:52.665 --> 07:54.665
I'm her husband! Why can't I go in?

07:54.745 --> 07:56.345
She's weak right now.

07:56.425 --> 07:57.945
It's fine. Let him in.

08:02.225 --> 08:03.865
How much longer
are you going to act crazy?

08:04.465 --> 08:05.785
Come home with me.

08:05.865 --> 08:06.905
Let go of me.

08:08.145 --> 08:09.065
Let go of me!

08:09.585 --> 08:10.505
Let… Let go…

08:14.545 --> 08:15.665
Jiang Zhiwen, listen to me.

08:16.345 --> 08:17.505
You can refuse to divorce,

08:17.585 --> 08:19.145
but I've already consulted a lawyer.

08:19.225 --> 08:21.225
You pushed me and caused a miscarriage.

08:21.305 --> 08:23.265
That counts as slight bodily injury.
You'll be held criminally liable.

08:23.945 --> 08:26.185
Believe me, if I press charges,

08:26.265 --> 08:30.945
your career will be ruined,
and if you remarry and have children,

08:31.025 --> 08:32.784
their background checks
for school and employment

08:32.865 --> 08:34.305
will always be an issue.

08:35.105 --> 08:36.664
I have video proof of you hitting her.

08:36.745 --> 08:38.105
When did you see me hit her?

08:46.105 --> 08:48.265
You two set me up, didn't you?

08:54.625 --> 08:55.705
Jiang Zhiwen.

08:56.665 --> 08:57.865
Let's get a divorce.

08:59.105 --> 09:01.785
Let's both keep some dignity.

09:02.665 --> 09:04.225
You want a divorce?

09:04.825 --> 09:05.865
Fine.

09:05.945 --> 09:07.985
Cash goes to you.
The apartment goes to me!

09:12.105 --> 09:16.025
Oh, and there's a fund maturing soon.

09:16.545 --> 09:17.865
That gets split equally!

09:19.345 --> 09:20.385
Get out!

09:22.865 --> 09:23.825
You crazy woman!

09:25.785 --> 09:27.465
I paid two-thirds
of the down payment on that apartment.

09:27.545 --> 09:28.745
I've paid more
on the mortgage than him, too.

09:28.825 --> 09:30.265
Why should the apartment go to him?

09:30.345 --> 09:32.585
The moment I'm discharged,
I'm filing for divorce.

09:32.665 --> 09:34.945
Ms. Huang told me
I can use that soon-to-mature trust

09:35.025 --> 09:37.785
to buy jewelry or designer bags.

09:37.865 --> 09:39.705
That way, they count as personal items

09:39.785 --> 09:41.305
and don't get split
in the property division.

09:42.425 --> 09:47.065
But isn't buying millions
in jewelry all at once a bit much?

09:47.145 --> 09:48.625
Would the court even accept that?

09:48.705 --> 09:50.625
There is a risk.

09:50.705 --> 09:53.065
But there's no better solution for now.

09:59.585 --> 10:00.985
Remember Fushun Insurance Group,
the one that handles

10:01.065 --> 10:02.625
our corporate medical insurance?

10:02.705 --> 10:06.105
I've been looking into digital finance
in the insurance sector lately,

10:06.185 --> 10:08.625
so I asked them for some materials.

10:08.705 --> 10:10.425
There was a marketing case study in there.

10:11.225 --> 10:14.985
Look. It says that according to the law,
the cash value of an insurance policy

10:15.065 --> 10:16.665
is considered marital property,

10:16.745 --> 10:19.785
but the insurance contract itself
belongs to the policyholder.

10:19.865 --> 10:22.425
I think you could ask a broker in Fushun

10:22.505 --> 10:25.065
to find you a short-to-medium-term policy

10:25.145 --> 10:26.825
with very low cash value
in the first two years.

10:27.665 --> 10:30.545
Say, only 10% of the total coverage?

10:30.625 --> 10:32.905
That way, after the divorce,
you only have to give him 5%.

10:32.985 --> 10:36.105
But when the contract matures,
you still get the full payout,

10:36.185 --> 10:38.305
plus decent returns.

10:38.385 --> 10:39.425
That's great.

10:39.505 --> 10:41.785
I'll check with my lawyer later
to see if this works.

10:41.865 --> 10:43.385
Okay. I'll send this over to you.

10:44.345 --> 10:45.985
-Thanks.
-No problem.

10:47.265 --> 10:48.385
Really, thank you.

10:51.145 --> 10:54.025
Think of it as my apology

10:54.105 --> 10:56.225
for causing that fight between you two
at Wanghu Pavilion Restaurant.

10:56.745 --> 10:57.625
Don't even bring that up.

10:57.705 --> 10:59.945
What I did was awful.

11:00.025 --> 11:03.025
Personally, I hate it when men
make unwanted advances at work.

11:03.105 --> 11:03.985
But I--

11:04.065 --> 11:05.345
We said we'd wipe the slate clean.

11:37.345 --> 11:39.025
FINTECH DEVELOPMENT

11:50.825 --> 11:51.585
Ms. Sha…

11:56.105 --> 11:57.585
Still researching digital finance?

11:58.225 --> 11:59.185
You really want to do this?

12:01.745 --> 12:05.025
You want advanced access to the company's
digital finance database?

12:06.505 --> 12:08.505
Looks like your workload
isn't heavy enough.

12:09.385 --> 12:11.865
I can always make time.

12:11.945 --> 12:14.345
I just want to learn as much as I can.

12:14.425 --> 12:16.385
Maxmise isn't a training center.

12:16.465 --> 12:18.625
The HR Statistical Yearbook says

12:18.705 --> 12:21.385
the first year is when new hires
learn the fastest.

12:21.465 --> 12:23.745
Well, you gave me a chance
on the Bolo Culture project.

12:23.825 --> 12:26.265
Maybe I can create even more value
for the company in the future.

12:26.345 --> 12:29.305
Ms. Sha, don't you love
ambitious subordinates?

12:31.625 --> 12:32.465
I'll think about it.

12:36.505 --> 12:37.985
Ma Ke has completed
his strategic hypothesis

12:38.065 --> 12:39.905
for Celestial Insurance's
digital transformation.

12:39.985 --> 12:42.105
They're in the strategy testing phase now.

12:42.185 --> 12:45.225
If you want, you can transfer
to that team soon.

12:46.025 --> 12:49.105
But your bonus on the Bolo Culture project
only runs through this week.

12:49.985 --> 12:51.785
I'd love to. Of course I would.

12:52.385 --> 12:56.785
But would it look bad
if I left in the middle of a project?

12:56.865 --> 12:58.905
One person less
won't affect the project's progress.

12:59.665 --> 13:03.265
Since Ye Xinzhi said
you're an explorer type,

13:03.345 --> 13:05.585
I'm willing to give you
a chance to transfer.

13:06.505 --> 13:09.065
Is it just because of him?

13:09.145 --> 13:10.545
Of course not.

13:10.625 --> 13:14.745
It's because you're smart, capable,
and hard-working enough.

13:16.585 --> 13:20.585
Lin Long told me
about the insurance advice you gave her.

13:20.665 --> 13:21.585
I think you have talent.

13:23.505 --> 13:24.625
Thank you, Ms. Sha.

13:25.985 --> 13:26.905
Alright.

13:27.425 --> 13:28.665
Go home and get some rest.

13:28.745 --> 13:29.665
Your health is yours alone.

13:30.585 --> 13:33.145
If you fall, someone
will replace you immediately.

13:33.985 --> 13:36.105
I'll make sure to exercise
and won't let that happen.

13:38.545 --> 13:39.745
-Bye.
-See you tomorrow.

13:53.225 --> 13:56.945
Ms. Lu said she hasn't found
a suitable place yet,

13:57.025 --> 13:59.585
so I asked an agent I know.

13:59.665 --> 14:02.985
This place is only three subway stations
from the office.

14:03.065 --> 14:04.185
Rent is reasonable too.

14:04.265 --> 14:05.305
MOM AND BABY IN GOOD HANDS
FAMILY CAN REST EASY

14:05.385 --> 14:06.225
Take a look.

14:07.065 --> 14:07.945
-Okay. Thanks.
-Just put it here.

14:08.025 --> 14:09.145
Sure.

14:10.025 --> 14:11.225
What do you think?

14:11.305 --> 14:13.305
I've rented in this complex before.

14:13.385 --> 14:14.785
It's good. No issues.

14:15.905 --> 14:18.345
Send me the agent's contact info later.

14:18.425 --> 14:19.785
I'll put down the deposit first.

14:21.345 --> 14:23.825
If you're comfortable with it,
give me your ID.

14:23.905 --> 14:25.185
I'll handle the paperwork for you.

14:25.785 --> 14:26.905
You haven't fully recovered yet.

14:26.985 --> 14:28.425
I'll take care of it for you.

14:28.505 --> 14:29.625
That would be great.

14:31.225 --> 14:32.545
But can you manage?

14:32.625 --> 14:35.905
Didn't you just start
on the Bolo Culture project?

14:36.545 --> 14:39.705
I transferred to Ma Ke's
Celestial Insurance project.

14:41.225 --> 14:42.825
Don't worry. I wasn't pushed out.

14:42.905 --> 14:46.425
I applied myself
because I wanted to try digital finance.

14:47.865 --> 14:50.385
I actually came by today
to let you know this.

14:51.385 --> 14:55.705
After all, you were the one
who took me to pitch Bolo Culture.

14:57.785 --> 14:58.785
True.

14:58.865 --> 15:01.905
Remember how we fought
tooth and nail over this project?

15:01.985 --> 15:04.225
And now neither of us is on it.

15:05.825 --> 15:09.065
Ma Ke can be a bit tricky.

15:09.145 --> 15:10.665
Keep your guard up.

15:11.305 --> 15:12.665
Okay. Got it.

15:13.185 --> 15:14.145
Don't worry about me.

15:14.225 --> 15:16.105
Your top priority
is to get your health back.

15:17.625 --> 15:20.105
Don't take this the wrong way.

15:21.345 --> 15:23.065
But there's one thing
I've never understood.

15:23.145 --> 15:25.745
What did you ever see
in a man like Jiang Zhiwen?

15:27.705 --> 15:30.545
Back then, I was much like you.

15:30.625 --> 15:31.745
I had just joined Maxmise.

15:32.265 --> 15:36.905
I was busy, exhausted,
and lonely every day.

15:36.985 --> 15:39.985
So it was easy to reach
for whatever warmth

15:41.025 --> 15:42.785
was within arm's reach.

15:46.705 --> 15:47.665
Good luck.

15:57.705 --> 15:59.625
Then why did you teach me
how to pick restaurants?

16:00.225 --> 16:01.745
Most people don't need to be taught that.

16:02.345 --> 16:04.825
I told you not to drink recklessly.

16:04.905 --> 16:07.105
Besides, I am here.

16:12.665 --> 16:16.145
Warmth within arm's reach.

16:20.985 --> 16:22.745
I've organized all the materials
on Benyuan Digital Collectibles.

16:22.825 --> 16:24.745
The key points are marked in highlighter.

16:27.585 --> 16:28.945
How are you settling
into the new project team?

16:30.505 --> 16:31.545
Pretty good.

16:32.345 --> 16:33.665
The project manager guiding me
is named Ma Ke.

16:33.745 --> 16:34.825
He's nice.

16:34.905 --> 16:37.145
He's already let me work
on designing solutions.

16:37.225 --> 16:38.265
And Yang Rui.

16:38.345 --> 16:40.545
He's teaching me
specific diagnostic techniques.

16:41.145 --> 16:44.145
Way more engaging than just
doing interviews and plugging into models.

16:44.785 --> 16:46.025
Who's Yang Rui?

16:46.105 --> 16:47.425
You never mentioned him before.

16:47.505 --> 16:49.945
I thought Bu Tianna
was your only friend at Maxmise.

16:53.545 --> 16:54.585
Thanks.

16:54.665 --> 16:56.665
This trekking pole is non-slip. Take it.

16:57.185 --> 16:58.385
Aren't you trying to win?

16:58.465 --> 17:00.105
If you slip and get hurt, you can't win.

17:00.185 --> 17:01.505
You're a good girl,

17:01.585 --> 17:04.025
and I hate seeing people
take advantage of you.

17:04.545 --> 17:06.385
Of course not.

17:06.905 --> 17:09.585
I hang out with colleagues all the time.

17:09.665 --> 17:10.905
See?

17:12.985 --> 17:13.865
Look.

17:14.385 --> 17:15.704
Us.

17:15.785 --> 17:16.785
This is Yang Rui.

17:16.865 --> 17:19.184
A buddy who's helped me out a lot.

17:19.265 --> 17:20.585
He's already a consultant.

17:20.665 --> 17:22.224
See? And this.

17:22.865 --> 17:23.704
DANCE BUDDY READY

17:24.305 --> 17:25.665
That's the two of us dancing.

17:26.825 --> 17:29.065
I think Shen Jin sent me that.

17:29.585 --> 17:30.665
Funny, huh?

17:30.745 --> 17:32.385
Look at your face.

17:32.465 --> 17:34.265
So funny. Is it funny?

17:34.905 --> 17:35.945
Yeah.

17:40.825 --> 17:41.665
Here.

17:41.745 --> 17:44.305
Let me teach you the Bottom-Up BPR method.

17:44.385 --> 17:45.225
You'll definitely need it later.

17:53.105 --> 17:53.945
Why are you staring at me?

17:55.145 --> 17:56.345
Nothing, nothing.

17:57.705 --> 17:58.945
What do you mean, nothing?

17:59.625 --> 18:00.625
Just say it.

18:07.905 --> 18:09.185
You look so worn out lately.

18:09.265 --> 18:10.825
Your dark circles are really bad,

18:10.905 --> 18:12.545
and the lines around your eyes
are so deep.

18:13.585 --> 18:15.065
-I've been staying up late lately.
-Right?

18:15.145 --> 18:16.265
Everyone can tell your energy's off.

18:16.345 --> 18:18.025
That won't do.

18:18.105 --> 18:20.425
How about this? I'll get you a thermos.

18:20.505 --> 18:22.865
You can steep some goji berries
and cassia seeds in it.

18:22.945 --> 18:24.505
It's really good for you. Seriously.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.345
No more coffee for you.

18:26.425 --> 18:27.745
Your blood is basically coffee.

18:27.825 --> 18:28.665
How about some goji berries?

18:30.345 --> 18:31.465
I'll order it right now.

18:32.585 --> 18:35.705
Well, goji berries.

18:35.785 --> 18:37.385
Gotta take care of yourself
as you get older.

18:37.465 --> 18:38.625
Otherwise, it's no good.

18:38.705 --> 18:41.025
I'll get the biggest thermos.

18:41.865 --> 18:42.945
Thanks.

18:43.585 --> 18:44.785
No worries.

18:48.585 --> 18:50.945
I won this round.

18:51.025 --> 18:53.905
He must be thinking that what he did
that day was totally unnecessary

18:53.985 --> 18:55.105
and presumptuous.

18:55.185 --> 18:56.025
Nice one.

18:56.105 --> 18:57.465
The key was that phrase "worn out".

18:57.545 --> 18:58.905
A single "you're outdated"

18:58.985 --> 19:01.865
was enough to shred
their pathetic confidence.

19:02.785 --> 19:03.985
Yeah.

19:04.065 --> 19:06.545
His face was hilarious.
I wish I could've taken a picture for you.

19:06.625 --> 19:08.825
He shouldn't have chosen that way
to crush my self-esteem.

19:10.385 --> 19:12.185
MA KE FROM MAXMISE

19:13.945 --> 19:16.265
I gotta go. Ma Ke is calling me.

19:16.345 --> 19:17.385
Wait.

19:17.465 --> 19:18.825
-There's something I want to tell you.
-What is it?

19:24.465 --> 19:25.585
Never mind.

19:25.665 --> 19:26.985
I'll tell you some other time.

19:36.305 --> 19:39.265
Sorry. I was on a call. What do you need?

19:39.345 --> 19:41.025
Bu Tianna is joining our project team.

19:41.865 --> 19:42.905
You two are close.

19:43.545 --> 19:45.185
I'll leave it to you to get her
up to speed on the project.

19:46.545 --> 19:47.465
Any issues?

19:47.985 --> 19:48.905
Okay.

19:51.305 --> 19:53.465
I thought Bu Tianna
was your only friend at Maxmise.

19:54.625 --> 19:58.105
Your friend Bu Tianna
is the one with the real connections.

20:00.185 --> 20:01.625
After this Bolo Culture deal is done,

20:01.705 --> 20:03.945
I'll go after digital finance clients.

20:04.025 --> 20:04.905
Digital finance?

20:05.705 --> 20:07.705
He said if you want to last in consulting,

20:07.785 --> 20:11.025
you have to choose industries with
big budgets and strong growth potential.

20:24.745 --> 20:25.665
It's about Bu Tianna, right?

20:27.905 --> 20:30.905
I was right there when she talked
to Mr. Pi yesterday.

20:30.985 --> 20:33.905
She said her family
is partnering with Ande Energy.

20:33.985 --> 20:36.185
She was worried about kickbacks
in the project,

20:36.265 --> 20:38.825
and she heard you say
digital finance has potential,

20:38.905 --> 20:40.505
so she wanted
to try switching project teams.

20:40.585 --> 20:41.505
With that said,

20:42.105 --> 20:43.945
of course, Mr. Pi moved her
to the Celestial project.

20:44.025 --> 20:46.105
But that puts you in a tough spot.

20:48.225 --> 20:50.865
The Celestial project has a lot going on.

20:50.945 --> 20:52.505
Having more colleagues around is fine.

20:56.305 --> 20:57.865
Stop pretending to be calm.

20:57.945 --> 21:00.865
Just stay away from Bu Tianna, will you?

21:01.705 --> 21:03.785
You used to be so sharp.

21:03.865 --> 21:06.225
Why are you so naive about this?

21:06.305 --> 21:08.065
What does someone like her,
born with a silver spoon,

21:08.145 --> 21:09.345
want from being close to you?

21:09.425 --> 21:11.345
Just another pair of eyes.

21:13.545 --> 21:14.385
Where are you going?

21:14.465 --> 21:17.225
I said I'm delivering
a document for Deng Anran.

21:19.745 --> 21:20.625
Did I hear that right?

21:20.705 --> 21:21.745
She's delivering documents for Deng Anran?

21:21.825 --> 21:22.985
Shouldn't she be helping Bu Tianna?

21:23.065 --> 21:24.385
Since when is she
so close with Deng Anran?

21:24.465 --> 21:25.505
You don't know?

21:26.025 --> 21:27.385
Bu Tianna applied to join…

21:29.545 --> 21:30.705
Really?

21:34.785 --> 21:36.745
You think there are real friends
in the office?

21:36.825 --> 21:39.385
You think chatting and having
lunch together makes you besties?

21:39.465 --> 21:41.145
Aren't you and Lin Long friends?

21:42.185 --> 21:43.265
We're different.

21:43.345 --> 21:45.785
We were college classmates
and roommates for four years.

21:45.865 --> 21:48.065
But I'll admit,

21:48.145 --> 21:50.385
if it came down to a promotion between us,

21:50.465 --> 21:51.985
I wouldn't hold back.

21:52.065 --> 21:55.345
That's exactly why Lin Long
and Cindy can't stand each other.

22:00.385 --> 22:01.825
Why do you keep helping me?

22:01.905 --> 22:05.065
I'm going to become a partner someday.

22:05.145 --> 22:07.425
I just want to start building
my inner circle early.

22:08.025 --> 22:09.465
Of course, I don't care.

22:10.345 --> 22:11.985
But don't act weak.

22:12.065 --> 22:13.625
Doesn't fit your image.

22:13.705 --> 22:17.465
I'm keeping you as my right hand,
not my friend.

22:17.545 --> 22:19.825
Right hand means trust.

22:19.905 --> 22:23.265
Competition for work
is normal in an office.

22:23.345 --> 22:24.625
You'll get used to it.

22:24.705 --> 22:27.545
In consulting, it all
comes down to ability.

22:27.625 --> 22:30.025
Why are you so interested in me today?

22:30.105 --> 22:33.865
Don't tell me you're jealous
I got promoted to SBA before you?

22:35.025 --> 22:37.985
We only met when we joined the company,
so why have you always been

22:38.585 --> 22:39.505
so nice to me?

22:39.585 --> 22:40.865
Because I like you.

22:40.945 --> 22:45.505
One of the reasons I like you is that
communication with you is so efficient.

22:53.945 --> 22:56.705
Chi. You're so good to me.

22:58.185 --> 22:59.785
You saved me that day.

23:00.385 --> 23:02.945
I'm going to be really,
really good to you from now on.

23:03.025 --> 23:04.425
You turn around. Turn around.

23:05.025 --> 23:06.265
I'll shield you.

23:08.945 --> 23:11.825
YE THE LEGEND

23:11.905 --> 23:12.985
YE THE LEGEND MISSED CALL

23:14.745 --> 23:15.665
YE THE LEGEND CALLING

24:14.145 --> 24:15.185
Sorry, Mom.

24:16.305 --> 24:17.665
I forgot what you told me.

24:18.825 --> 24:20.465
I easily trusted someone too.

24:21.305 --> 24:23.465
And now I've become their stepping stone.

24:52.465 --> 24:55.185
Xu Chi, you haven't answered your phone
or replied to WeChat all afternoon.

24:55.265 --> 24:56.265
I called your company,

24:56.345 --> 24:57.305
and the front desk said
they couldn't reach you.

24:58.385 --> 24:59.545
I'm fine.

24:59.625 --> 25:01.705
But Du was worried about you.
He asked me to find you.

25:01.785 --> 25:03.225
How did you know I was here?

25:03.985 --> 25:06.985
I remembered you said
your mom's old apartment was around here.

25:07.585 --> 25:08.665
So I came to check.

25:11.105 --> 25:11.945
I'm fine.

25:15.545 --> 25:16.705
You call this fine?

25:18.185 --> 25:19.025
Look at yourself.

26:03.265 --> 26:04.105
What happened?

26:09.505 --> 26:11.065
I've been looking for you all afternoon.

26:11.145 --> 26:12.865
Just tell me. What happened?

26:12.945 --> 26:14.545
I don't want to talk to you, okay?

26:28.105 --> 26:29.025
Fine.

26:30.065 --> 26:31.545
Self-punishment and now self-isolation?

26:34.065 --> 26:35.145
I'll play along.

27:32.785 --> 27:34.225
-What are you doing?
-You're awake?

27:34.305 --> 27:36.105
-What are you doing, Ye Xinzhi?
-Relax.

27:36.185 --> 27:37.665
-This is a closed road.
-No cars. No people.

27:37.745 --> 27:39.745
-What are you doing? Stop the car!
-Hold on!

27:43.025 --> 27:44.145
Stop the car!

27:46.785 --> 27:48.865
Ye Xinzhi! What are you doing?

27:49.385 --> 27:50.145
Stop!

27:52.385 --> 27:54.265
Are you crazy? Stop the car!

28:01.905 --> 28:02.985
Are you insane?

28:03.065 --> 28:04.185
Ye Xinzhi, what are you doing?

28:12.705 --> 28:15.065
Did that help ease the heaviness
in your chest a little?

29:36.025 --> 29:37.065
Done crying?

29:39.945 --> 29:40.905
Sorry.

29:41.545 --> 29:44.985
I shouldn't have snapped at you.

29:47.225 --> 29:48.985
Don't apologize at a time like this.

29:49.945 --> 29:54.745
Getting backstabbed by someone
you trusted at work really hurts.

29:56.425 --> 29:57.905
You'll get used to it after a few times.

30:00.505 --> 30:02.425
I'm not sad.

30:02.505 --> 30:05.905
I just feel like such an idiot.

30:05.985 --> 30:07.585
Ever since my mom left,

30:07.665 --> 30:10.425
I swore I'd be independent and guarded.

30:10.505 --> 30:12.185
That I wouldn't trust or depend on anyone.

30:12.905 --> 30:16.425
But just because Bu Tianna
helped me a few times,

30:17.305 --> 30:18.825
I let my guard down.

30:18.905 --> 30:19.985
I even…

30:21.785 --> 30:23.785
I don't like him.

30:24.385 --> 30:25.665
I just…

30:26.665 --> 30:28.985
I just had a little crush.

30:29.065 --> 30:30.385
I only saved one photo.

30:30.465 --> 30:32.425
Is that not allowed?
Do I have to be warned for that?

30:36.785 --> 30:39.065
I even told her everything on my mind.

30:40.265 --> 30:41.585
And now here I am.

30:49.905 --> 30:51.145
Where are you at now?

30:52.865 --> 30:54.105
She just joined that project team.

30:54.185 --> 30:56.665
The fight hasn't even started yet,
and you're already giving up?

30:57.785 --> 31:01.825
Or do you think you don't even have
what it takes to compete with her?

31:03.505 --> 31:05.785
I don't think you're crying
because you feel stupid.

31:06.425 --> 31:08.785
Deep down, you're insecure.

31:09.385 --> 31:10.705
After all this,

31:10.785 --> 31:12.945
you don't even have the courage
to confront her.

31:15.865 --> 31:17.025
Am I right?

31:20.385 --> 31:21.465
Answer me.

31:31.505 --> 31:32.545
Yes.

31:34.345 --> 31:35.745
You can still answer me.

31:36.265 --> 31:37.225
That means there's still hope.

31:39.665 --> 31:40.825
Anything else you can't figure out?

31:40.905 --> 31:41.745
Spill it one by one.

31:41.825 --> 31:43.905
Full confession gets you leniency.

31:48.985 --> 31:49.945
Actually…

31:52.305 --> 31:56.065
Even though I always said
I didn't envy Bu Tianna's advantages,

31:56.145 --> 31:59.065
I've been avoiding
a head-to-head competition with her

31:59.145 --> 32:00.065
because I'm afraid of losing.

32:00.985 --> 32:04.625
You know, I've never lost
a competition since college,

32:04.705 --> 32:06.905
so I'm scared that if I lose to her,

32:07.425 --> 32:08.585
my perfect record will be broken.

32:09.185 --> 32:10.305
I don't want to be replaced.

32:15.105 --> 32:16.185
You know the hand-slap game?

32:19.745 --> 32:20.945
What for?

32:32.745 --> 32:34.225
You said you've never lost, right?

32:34.825 --> 32:35.705
I'll go.

33:01.625 --> 33:02.825
Lose a few times,

33:02.905 --> 33:05.105
and all that junk in your head
will disappear.

33:06.105 --> 33:08.145
Remember, you're someone I chose.

33:08.945 --> 33:11.785
Even if you don't believe in yourself,
at least believe in my judgment.

33:12.625 --> 33:15.145
Tomorrow when you go back to the office,
don't overthink it.

33:15.225 --> 33:16.465
Just go head-to-head with her.

33:16.545 --> 33:19.665
If you win, stop the self-punishment.

33:19.745 --> 33:22.385
If you lose, come learn from me.

33:22.985 --> 33:24.345
I'm not self-punishing.

33:25.225 --> 33:28.505
I'm just working off my anxiety.

33:28.585 --> 33:31.305
My therapist said this is a way to--

33:31.385 --> 33:33.865
Stop with all those weird thoughts.

33:34.705 --> 33:35.545
I get it.

33:36.225 --> 33:37.425
You think I never went
through an angsty phase?

33:45.025 --> 33:46.865
You can still laugh.
That means you're fine.

33:47.785 --> 33:48.625
Get in the car.

33:48.705 --> 33:49.985
I've been waiting for you long enough.

33:50.065 --> 33:52.145
At my age, this isn't easy.

33:56.265 --> 33:57.705
Don't play the victim.

33:57.785 --> 33:59.225
How old are you anyway?

34:01.865 --> 34:03.665
You're the one who said I was old.

34:03.745 --> 34:05.105
Said my crow's feet
were really noticeable.

34:05.625 --> 34:07.265
I'm keeping a running tally, you know.

34:24.585 --> 34:27.025
Do you go there often?

34:27.705 --> 34:32.784
When I'm stressed, sad,
or having nightmares.

34:34.025 --> 34:36.264
Someone as strong as you has nightmares?

34:36.865 --> 34:38.385
Everyone has their weaknesses.

34:39.385 --> 34:42.225
I am afraid of heights.

34:43.304 --> 34:44.145
Afraid of losing control.

34:44.784 --> 34:47.865
So whenever I go somewhere high,
I can't sleep.

34:49.665 --> 34:51.985
But you fly all the time…

34:52.065 --> 34:53.505
There's glass, so it's okay.

34:54.505 --> 34:56.985
Or if I'm far enough away,
it'll be better.

34:58.105 --> 34:59.025
Anyway,

34:59.745 --> 35:02.465
I think that place can heal me.

35:03.065 --> 35:04.345
So it can heal you too.

35:20.465 --> 35:21.465
Richard.

35:24.225 --> 35:25.505
Why do you care so much about me?

35:25.585 --> 35:26.945
Why do you help me so much?

35:27.025 --> 35:27.905
Do you…

35:31.665 --> 35:32.945
Do you like me?

35:48.065 --> 35:50.185
Can you not joke like that
when I'm driving?

35:53.705 --> 35:55.585
I'm not joking.

35:56.585 --> 35:57.665
Richard.

35:57.745 --> 36:01.025
I may be young,
but I'm not clueless about feelings.

36:01.105 --> 36:03.745
You've always been so good to me.

36:04.505 --> 36:05.465
I'm an adult.

36:05.545 --> 36:07.265
What danger could I possibly
be in in Beijing?

36:07.905 --> 36:10.505
You said Du was worried about me,
but I barely know him.

36:10.585 --> 36:12.665
So it was actually you
who was worried, right?

36:13.705 --> 36:18.185
If I chalked it all up
to a senior appreciating talent,

36:18.705 --> 36:20.025
that feels like a stretch,

36:20.105 --> 36:21.945
but then the other day at your apartment,

36:22.025 --> 36:23.985
you deliberately let me see that.

36:24.065 --> 36:26.225
So I'm really confused.

36:26.825 --> 36:27.905
But don't worry.

36:27.985 --> 36:31.585
I'm not asking all this to prove anything.

36:31.665 --> 36:32.665
I just…

36:33.505 --> 36:36.025
I just want to know where we stand.

36:36.625 --> 36:37.705
You're right.

36:38.865 --> 36:40.225
Of course I have feelings for you.

36:54.025 --> 36:58.385
If I didn't, why would I keep helping you?

37:00.265 --> 37:02.425
But there are many kinds of feelings.

37:02.505 --> 37:03.945
Not just romantic ones.

37:04.625 --> 37:07.185
It's like liking a celebrity.

37:07.265 --> 37:09.305
That doesn't mean I want to date them.

37:10.385 --> 37:14.145
There's a lot of gray
between black and white.

37:15.185 --> 37:18.345
When you interviewed,
you left a strong impression on me.

37:18.945 --> 37:21.065
And your personality,

37:21.145 --> 37:23.305
your way of thinking,
and how you handle things

37:23.825 --> 37:25.345
all click with mine.

37:26.065 --> 37:27.065
I help you

37:27.145 --> 37:29.985
not just because I hope you'll become
my assistant someday.

37:30.745 --> 37:31.785
I also want

37:32.665 --> 37:35.705
to make it up to my younger self
for a regret from back then.

37:36.785 --> 37:38.105
What regret?

37:38.785 --> 37:40.225
Don't tell me I look like your ex-wife.

37:43.505 --> 37:44.945
You watch too many dramas.

37:46.225 --> 37:47.785
Back when I was betrayed

37:48.745 --> 37:50.505
and at my lowest,

37:51.505 --> 37:52.705
no one

37:54.305 --> 37:56.465
came out of nowhere to pull me up.

37:57.745 --> 37:59.145
All your life,

37:59.225 --> 38:01.305
you fight for power,
and you toil and struggle.

38:01.385 --> 38:03.305
You finally make it over one small hill,

38:03.385 --> 38:06.065
just to have the freedom
to do what you want.

38:07.865 --> 38:08.985
I wasn't lucky back then.

38:09.065 --> 38:11.025
I never got my angel.

38:11.985 --> 38:13.545
Since I have that chance now,

38:14.625 --> 38:16.345
let me be your angel.

38:36.705 --> 38:38.345
POST

38:38.425 --> 38:41.705
I have a friend
who met someone really good to her.

38:43.065 --> 38:47.185
But even though they said they liked her,
it wasn't in a romantic way.

38:49.825 --> 38:52.625
My friend says she feels
both calm and lost.

38:53.305 --> 38:55.065
How should I help her?

38:58.305 --> 38:59.705
What I want to tell you is that

38:59.785 --> 39:05.425
I think you're a very smart
and capable girl.

39:06.025 --> 39:12.825
And I really enjoy working with you, too.

39:14.105 --> 39:15.385
You get what I mean?

39:15.465 --> 39:17.465
Of course. Got it. I misunderstood.

39:20.505 --> 39:23.945
It's just that basic appreciation.
Between people.

39:24.025 --> 39:25.265
You must have scored full marks

39:25.345 --> 39:27.785
on listening and reading
comprehension in college.

39:30.265 --> 39:32.905
I also scored high
on stress tolerance in my psych test.

39:33.585 --> 39:34.585
Really.

39:38.425 --> 39:39.825
HIDE FROM TAG: CLIENTS
FRIENDS: YE THE LEGEND, TINA

39:42.225 --> 39:44.145
KEEP THIS EDIT? DISCARD, KEEP

39:48.265 --> 39:49.985
DISCARD
